    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/9e2ee05df37a4ebc00fe1785a0460c5b.avif?t=1754839613\" width=600 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Road To Yvhalon</i></strong> is a  action RPG specifically designed for Virtual Reality that merges the cryptic allure of soulslike games with a vast, non-linear world crafted for exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/d3feb908d49265478cef3f8109d395f6.poster.avif?t=1754839613\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/d3feb908d49265478cef3f8109d395f6.webm?t=1754839613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/d3feb908d49265478cef3f8109d395f6.mp4?t=1754839613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through forgotten lands, ancient ruins, and hidden trails. The road is only the beginning\u2014true discovery lies off the path.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/5d4724808aebfc8355152cbe979a48dd.avif?t=1754839613\" width=600 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face arcane demons in ritual-like duels using a <strong>sword pose system</strong>, where stance and intention shape the flow of combat. Every encounter is a deadly dance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/9785af08add0645c493869b4dbc807ff.avif?t=1754839613\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge legendary blades by merging natural resources with fragments of demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/681c83b2d8a6226126dbf4eaedb56760.avif?t=1754839613\" width=600 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal the souls of your foes through the <strong>SoulCapture</strong> system and command otherworldly powers\u2014flames, shadows, teleportation, visions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a world that doesn\u2019t guide you\u2014it challenges you. <i>Road To Yvhalon</i> is the path, but also what you find by losing your way.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/9e2ee05df37a4ebc00fe1785a0460c5b.avif?t=1754839613\" width=600 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Road To Yvhalon</i></strong> is a  action RPG specifically designed for Virtual Reality that merges the cryptic allure of soulslike games with a vast, non-linear world crafted for exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/d3feb908d49265478cef3f8109d395f6.poster.avif?t=1754839613\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/d3feb908d49265478cef3f8109d395f6.webm?t=1754839613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/d3feb908d49265478cef3f8109d395f6.mp4?t=1754839613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through forgotten lands, ancient ruins, and hidden trails. The road is only the beginning\u2014true discovery lies off the path.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/5d4724808aebfc8355152cbe979a48dd.avif?t=1754839613\" width=600 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face arcane demons in ritual-like duels using a <strong>sword pose system</strong>, where stance and intention shape the flow of combat. Every encounter is a deadly dance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/9785af08add0645c493869b4dbc807ff.avif?t=1754839613\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge legendary blades by merging natural resources with fragments of demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/681c83b2d8a6226126dbf4eaedb56760.avif?t=1754839613\" width=600 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal the souls of your foes through the <strong>SoulCapture</strong> system and command otherworldly powers\u2014flames, shadows, teleportation, visions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a world that doesn\u2019t guide you\u2014it challenges you. <i>Road To Yvhalon</i> is the path, but also what you find by losing your way.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Road To Yvhalon is an action RPG specifically designed for Virtual Reality. Explore stunning maps, craft epic swords, defeat mysterious demons, and steal their souls to harness their powers!",
